IMPORTANT
=========

Make a copy of your datafile before you convert it!

BUSDAT 2.04 and later uses a different database file format to earlier versions
you can convert an old file using the TRANS.OPO program.

This converts the loc::m:\dat\busdat.dat file to loc::m:\dat\busdat2.dat
if your data is normally on A: or B: - copy it to M: for conversion, then
copy the busdat2.dat file to your usual drive.

To run the TRANS program, copy it to your m:\opo directory and then run it.
